abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of wave-state computing built from the
  phase-coherence function C_seq of Coherent Sequence theory:
  digital-to-wave BPSK encoding, holographic associative memory via
  interference, fidelity readout as C_seq, OES-32 lock-in detection,
  and SHA-256 evidence passports. Classical simulation; all signals
  synthetic.
